### Variaveis
@host = http://localhost:4000
@token = COLE_O_JWT_DO_USUARIO_AQUI
@tokenOther = COLE_O_JWT_DE_OUTRO_USUARIO_AQUI
@ideaTypeId = COLE_O_ID_RETORNADO_NA_LISTAGEM_OU_NO_BANCO

### Registrar usuario para gerar token (espera 201)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tipo Owner",
  "email": "owner.idea-type@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Login (espera 200 com token)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner.idea-type@example.com",
  "password": "Strong@123"
}

### Criar Tipo de Ideia valido (espera 201)
POST {{host}}/idea-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produto Digital",
  "description": "Tipo voltado para produtos digitais SaaS.",
  "prompt": "Avalie {{name}}, {{description}}, {{objective}} e {{resources}}."
}

### Criar faltando campos (espera 422 idea-type.name.required, idea-type.description.required, idea-type.prompt.required)
POST {{host}}/idea-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "",
  "prompt": ""
}

### Prompt acima do limite (espera 422 idea-type.prompt.max.length)
POST {{host}}/idea-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tipo Prompt Grande",
  "description": "Descricao valida do agregado.",
  "prompt": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}
# Repetir o bloco AAAAA ate exceder 8000 caracteres ao reproduzir o cenario.

### Carregar Tipos de Ideia padrao - primeira vez (espera 200 com { "loaded": 4 } enquanto o usuario nao tem nenhum cadastrado)
POST {{host}}/idea-types/load-defaults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Carregar Tipos de Ideia padrao - segunda vez seguida (espera 200 com { "loaded": 0 } pelo gate de idempotencia)
POST {{host}}/idea-types/load-defaults
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirmar que nao houve duplicacao apos o segundo load (total deve continuar igual ao do primeiro load)
GET {{host}}/idea-types?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Tipos de Ideia paginado (espera 200 com items + total)
GET {{host}}/idea-types?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por id valido (espera 200)
GET {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por id de outro usuario (espera 404 idea-type.not_found)
GET {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOther}}

### Atualizar Tipo de Ideia valido (espera 204)
PUT {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produto Digital v2",
  "description": "Descricao atualizada do tipo.",
  "prompt": "Atualizado: {{name}}, {{description}}, {{objective}}, {{resources}}."
}

### Atualizar cross-user (espera 403 idea-type.forbidden)
PUT {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOther}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invasor",
  "description": "Tentativa de atualizar tipo de outro usuario.",
  "prompt": "Prompt valido com {{name}} usado para checagem."
}

### Deletar inexistente (espera 404 idea-type.not_found)
DELETE {{host}}/idea-types/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deletar cross-user (espera 403 idea-type.forbidden)
DELETE {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenOther}}

### Deletar valido (espera 204)
DELETE {{host}}/idea-types/{{ideaTypeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
